<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ro">

<head>
    <title>Libraria BookMaxx</title>
    <meta name="keywords"
        content="carte, autor, bucuresti, literatura, manual, abecedar, probleme, fictiune, librarie, magazin, pagini, academician">
    <meta name="description" content="Magazin online de carti, manuale, suveniruri.">

    <%- include('../fragmente/head.ejs') %>

</head>

<body id="acasa">
    <header>
        <hgroup>
            <h1>
                <i class="fa-solid fa-book-open fa-spin" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                Libraria BookMaxx
            </h1>
            <p>O librarie online</p>
        </hgroup>
        <%- include('../fragmente/header.ejs') %>

            <main class="grid-container">

                <section id="despre" class="zona-1">
                    <h2>Despre librarie</h2>
                    <p>Suntem o librarie pentru iubitorii de lectura.</p>

                    <p>IP-ul tău este: <%- locals.ip %></p>

                    <article>
                        <h3>Scopul librariei</h3>
                        <p>Ne dorim sa aducem cele mai bune titluri aproape de voi.</p>
                        <blockquote>"Ai carte ai parte."</blockquote>
                        <p>Daca te consideri <dfn
                                title="Iubitor si colectionar de carti rare si pretioase.">bibliofil</dfn>
                            atunci libraria noastra este perfecta pentru tine.</p>
                    </article>

                    <figure>
                        <picture>
                            <img src="/resurse/imagini/carte_mica.jpg" alt="Carte Isaac" title="imagine carte mica">
                        </picture>
                        <figcaption>O carte laudata de critici.</figcaption>
                    </figure>

                    <p>Poti descarca catalogul nostru aici:
                        <a href="/resurse/Catalog.pdf" download="Catalog_2026.pdf">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-file-arrow-down" aria-hidden="true"></i> Descarca catalogul
                        </a>
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section class="zona-5">
                    <h3><i class="fa-solid fa-users" aria-hidden="true"></i> Utilizatori online</h3>
                    <p>In acest moment, <strong>47 de persoane</strong> navigheaza pe site-ul nostru.</p>
                    <p>Cel mai vizitat capitol astazi: <em>Fictiune &amp; Literatura</em></p>
                </section>

                <section class="zona-6">
                    <h3><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-bar" aria-hidden="true"></i> Date statistici</h3>
                    <dl>
                        <dt>Carti in catalog</dt>
                        <dd>2.350 titluri</dd>
                        <dt>Comenzi luna aceasta</dt>
                        <dd>312 comenzi</dd>
                        <dt>Rating mediu clienti</dt>
                        <dd>4.8 / 5 &#11088;</dd>
                        <dt>Timp mediu livrare</dt>
                        <dd>2.3 zile</dd>
                    </dl>
                </section>

                <section class="zona-7">
                    <h3><i class="fa-solid fa-server" aria-hidden="true"></i> Date server</h3>
                    <p>Spatiu stocare utilizat:
                        <meter value="65" min="0" max="100" low="80" high="90" optimum="30"></meter> 65%
                    </p>
                    <p>Incarcare server:
                        <meter value="30" min="0" max="100" low="70" high="85" optimum="20"></meter> 30%
                    </p>
                    <p>Backup ultima data: <time datetime="2026-05-14">14 Mai 2026</time></p>
                </section>

                <section id="evenimente" class="zona-3">
                    <h2>Evenimente</h2>
                    <ol>
                        <li>
                            <time datetime="2026-04-10T18:30">10 Aprilie, ora 18:30</time> - <b>Lansare de carte</b>:
                            Un nou roman publicat de Mircea Cartarescu, <abbr title="academician">acad</abbr>. Autorul
                            va oferi
                            autografe.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <time datetime="2026-04-15T12:00">15 Aprilie, ora 12:00</time> - <b>Carti cadou</b>:
                            Oferim tuturor vizitatorilor cate o carte gratuita.
                        </li>
                    </ol>
                </section>

                <section class="zona-4">
                    <h3>Anunturi</h3>
                    <details>
                        <summary>&#127881; Reduceri de Mai &#8212; <time datetime="2026-05-01">1 Mai 2026</time>
                        </summary>
                        <p>Reduceri de pana la <strong>30%</strong> la toate cartile de fictiune si poezie.</p>
                    </details>
                    <details>
                        <summary>&#128230; Livrare gratuita &#8212; <time datetime="2026-05-10">10 Mai 2026</time>
                        </summary>
                        <p>Comenzi peste <strong>150 RON</strong> beneficiaza de livrare gratuita in toata tara.</p>
                    </details>
                    <details>
                        <summary>&#128218; Colectie noua &#8212; <time datetime="2026-05-14">14 Mai 2026</time>
                        </summary>
                        <p>Au sosit titluri noi din colectia <em>Classici Universali</em>.</p>
                    </details>
                </section>

                <section id="stocuri">
                    <h2>Stocuri</h2>
                    <p>Stoc "Harry Potter" de J.K Rowling <strong>(Cerere mare)</strong>:
                        <meter value="12" min="0" max="100" low="20" high="80" optimum="90"></meter> - Ultimele articole
                    </p>
                    <p>Stoc "Ion" de Liviu Rebreanu:
                        <meter value="85" min="0" max="100" low="20" high="80" optimum="90"></meter> - Stoc suficient
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="top-vanzari">
                    <h2>Top Vanzari luna trecuta</h2>
                    <div class="container-tabel">
                        <table>
                            <caption>Cele mai vandute carti si incasarile vanzarilor</caption>
                            <thead>
                                <tr>
                                    <th>Titlu carte</th>
                                    <th>Autor</th>
                                    <th>Exemplare vandute</th>
                                    <th>Pret</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody>
                                <tr>
                                    <td>Metamorfoza</td>
                                    <td>Franz Kafka</td>
                                    <td>150</td>
                                    <td>35 RON</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td>Micul Print</td>
                                    <td>Antoine de Saint-Exupery</td>
                                    <td>120</td>
                                    <td>25 RON</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td>Pacienta tacuta</td>
                                    <td>Alex Michaelides</td>
                                    <td>95</td>
                                    <td>40 RON</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td rowspan="2">Pachet Promo: Morometii vol. 1 si vol. 2</td>
                                    <td rowspan="2">Marin Preda</td>
                                    <td>Vol 1: 80</td>
                                    <td>50 RON</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td>Vol 2: 75</td>
                                    <td>50 RON</td>
                                </tr>
                            </tbody>
                            <tfoot>
                                <tr>
                                    <th colspan="4">Date actualizate la finalul lunii trecute.</th>
                                </tr>
                            </tfoot>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <section class="zona-8">
                    <div id="stocuri-2">
                        <h2>Stocuri</h2>
                        <p>Stoc "Harry Potter" de J.K Rowling <strong>(Cerere mare)</strong>:
                            <meter value="12" min="0" max="100" low="20" high="80" optimum="90"></meter> - Ultimele
                            articole
                        </p>
                        <p>Stoc "Ion" de Liviu Rebreanu:
                            <meter value="85" min="0" max="100" low="20" high="80" optimum="90"></meter> - Stoc
                            suficient
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <section id="faq">
                        <h2>Intrebari frecvente</h2>
                        <details>
                            <summary>Cat dureaza livrarea?</summary>
                            <p>Livrarea dureaza intre 2 si 4 zile lucratoare.</p>
                        </details>
                        <details>
                            <summary>Pot returna o carte?</summary>
                            <p>Da, orice carte poate fi returnata in maxim 14 zile de la achizitie, cu conditia sa nu
                                fie
                                deteriorata.</p>
                        </details>
                    </section>

                    <section id="media">
                        <h2>Media</h2>
                        <p>Puteti citi mai multe despre importanta cititului aici:
                            <a href="https://www.dictie.ro/20-de-motive-pentru-care-cititul-este-important/"
                                target="_blank">Importanta cititului</a>
                        </p>
                        <div class="container-iframe-taburi">
                            <nav class="meniu-taburi">
                                <a href="https://www.youtube.com/embed/jfKfPfyJRdk" target="video_player">Recenzie
                                    Cartea 1</a>
                                <a href="https://www.youtube.com/embed/tgbNymZ7vqY" target="video_player">Recenzie
                                    Cartea 2</a>
                                <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Book" target="video_player">Despre Carti
                                    (Wiki)</a>
                            </nav>
                            <iframe name="video_player" class="iframe-continut" src="about:blank"
                                title="Player video si continut"></iframe>
                        </div>

                        <section id="videoclip">
                            <h2>Videoclip promotional</h2>
                            <video controls preload="none" poster="/resurse/imagini/poster-video.jpg"
                                class="video-promotional">
                                <source src="/resurse/video/librarie tur.mp4" type="video/mp4">
                                <source src="/resurse/video/librarie tur.webm" type="video/webm">

                                <track kind="subtitles" src="/resurse/vtt/ro.vtt" srclang="ro" label="Română" default>
                                <track kind="subtitles" src="/resurse/vtt/en.vtt" srclang="en" label="English">

                                Browserul tau nu suporta tagul video.
                            </video>
                        </section>
                    </section>
                </section>
            </main>

            <%- include('../fragmente/footer.ejs') %>

                <script>
                    const hamburgerBtn = document.getElementById('hamburger-btn');
                    const navList = document.getElementById('nav-list');
                    const mainNav = document.getElementById('main-nav');

                    function toggleMenu() {
                        mainNav.classList.toggle('menu-open');
                        navList.classList.toggle('open');
                    }

                    hamburgerBtn.addEventListener('click', toggleMenu);
                    hamburgerBtn.addEventListener('keydown', e => {
                        if (e.key === 'Enter' || e.key === ' ') toggleMenu();
                    });

                    document.querySelectorAll('.nav-item > a').forEach(link => {
                        link.addEventListener('click', e => {
                            if (window.innerWidth <= 480) {
                                const submenu = link.nextElementSibling;
                                if (submenu && submenu.classList.contains('submenu')) {
                                    e.preventDefault();
                                    submenu.classList.toggle('submenu-open');
                                }
                            }
                        });
                    });
                </script>
</body>

</html>